In this section, we will   present the selection of two random variables, namely $y_{1}$ and $y_{2}$. The probability density function of random variable $y_{i}$ is represented by $f_{i}(\cdot)$, and $F_{i}(\cdot)$ stands for the cumulative distribution function of $y_{i}$.}

