\paragraph{Structured Output Format}
Each verification task produces results in a standardized and structured format, making the outputs easily usable in downstream tools or documentation pipelines. For example, generated properties are output in syntactically correct .sva files, suitable for direct inclusion in formal verification flows. Asset identification results are formatted as JSON objects, allowing for further analysis or integration into security review documentation. 
