\subsection{Physics Informed Neural Networks (PINNs)} 

%Overall, by integrating data-driven insights with physics-based constraints, PINNs offer a unique framework for solving inverse problems, finding wide-ranging applications in mechanical, material, environmental, and biological sciences \cite{Orth2010, Palsson2015}.

