\begin{axiom}\label{ax:cNASbasis}{\bf (Characteristically Close Equivalence Class Axiom).}\\
Every nonempty set objects can be partitioned into  equivalence classes containing characteristically close objects.
\end{axiom}

\end{mdframed}

