\begin{example}\label{ex:sim}{\bf (Sample \boxed{frx\ \widetilde{\Phi}\ fry} Video Frame Equivalence Relations).}\\
A sample pair of characteristically near biker motion vector fields are shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:bikerVfs}.  For simplicity, we consider only three characteristics of these vector fields, namely,
\begin{align*}
\boldsymbol{\Phi} &= \boldsymbol{\left\{\varphi_{1_{\lambda_{max}}},
\varphi_{2_{stable}},
\varphi_{3_{unstable}}\right\}},i.e.,\\
