& \quad ~ \prod_{[ijk] \in V} ({}^A\overline{F}_{ijk}^a)^{s_{ijk}} ({}^BF_{ijk}^b)^{s_{ijk}} \ket{\{g_i, (a, b)_{ij}\}}.
\end{aligned}
\end{equation}
The above ground states can be represented by the following double-layered tensor network:
