When $A = \Vec_H^{\nu}$, the physical legs on the edges of the top layer are uniquely determined by the other physical legs, due to \eqref{eq: non-min non-miin GS TN P}, \eqref{eq: non-min non-miin GS TN E}, and \eqref{eq: non-min non-miin GS TN VA}.
