\label{subsec:robustness_checks}

To evaluate training stability, we varied key hyperparameters: the actor learning rate ($\{5 \times 10^{-5}, 2 \times 10^{-4}\}$), discount factor ($\{0.95, 0.99\}$), and mini-batch size ($\{512, 2048\}$). Across all configurations, final cumulative rewards remained in a tight range between 310.8 and 330.5, with standard deviations below 7.5 in every case.

