In particular, for $n=1$, it follows that
\begin{equation}
\omega _{A}(S^{\sharp _{A}}T)\leq \frac{1}{2} \left\Vert T^{\sharp
_{A}}T+S^{\sharp _{A}}S \right\Vert _{A}\text{.}  \label{7}
