\section{Main results}\label{sec3}


Here, we study our main results. We begin by introducing a new seminorm on ${\mathcal{B}}_{A^{{1}/{2}}}\left( {
\mathcal{H}}\right) ^{n}$.
\begin{definition}
    Let $\mathbf{T}=\left( T_{1},\cdots ,T_{n}\right) \in {\mathcal{B}}_{A^{
{1}/{2}}}\left( {\mathcal{H}}\right) ^{n}$ be an $n$-tuple
and let $\alpha ,\beta \geq 0$ such that $\left( \alpha ,\beta \right) \neq
\left( 0,0\right) $. Consider a mapping $\left\Vert \mathbf{\cdot }%
