\end{align}
Since $\zeta(0,1)=\zeta(0)=-1/2$ and $\zeta'(0,1)=\zeta'(0)=-\frac{1}{2}\log{2\pi}$, \eqref{zeta(0,a)2} and \eqref{zeta'(0,a)} hold for $a=1$ as well.
