where $\psi(s)$ is the digamma function.\\
While the representation given in \eqref{funceqexp} will be helpful to calculate the exact terms in the formulas of $\Delta_a(x,h/k)$ that will follow, it will be more convenient to use \eqref{altfunceq} in estimating the bound for $F(s,h/k)$.

