    \caption{Corner plot of the posterior distributions obtained from the calibration algorithm, normalized to $C_1$. The diagonal panels show the 1D histograms of each PMT calibration parameter $C_i$, while the off-diagonal panels display the scatter plots of the corresponding parameter pairs, along with their correlation. The labels in the diagonal histograms report the 16th, 50th, and 84th percentiles of each distribution.}
